#!/usr/bin/env python3
"""Unified state-machine tool to observe and transition the Pixel phone state.

Usage:
  tools/phone goto TARGET [--timeout S] [--dry-run] [--yes-user-actions]
  tools/phone state
  tools/phone --self-test

TARGET is one of: fastboot, recovery, android, ios, absent.
Output: <= 6 short lines, last line:
  RESULT: PASS|FAIL|PARTIAL|ERROR state=<final> target=<target> steps=<n>
Exit codes: 0 PASS / 1 FAIL or PARTIAL / 2 ERROR.
Details logged to logs/phone/<timestamp>/phone.log.

Hardware and protocol citations:
  - Shim USB gadget VID:PID 1209:0001 (CDC-ACM serial log, /dev/ttyACM*):
    shim/usbproto.c:33-44, tools/usb-log.py:5,24-25, device/google/bluejay/docs/GATE0.md:163,
    device/google/bluejay/docs/GATE0_RESULTS.md:25, docs/tasks/usb-stage2.md:23, tools/probe-run:74.
  - iOS XNU USB Ethernet CDC-ECM gadget VID:PID 1209:0001, host MAC 02:00:5e:77:ee:01,
    IP 192.168.7.2, UDP console log port 5140:
    tools/xrun:61-69, tools/usbnet-log.py:3-10,36-39, tools/sweet-usbnet.sh:7-8,
    docs/HANDOFF.md:496, docs/research/03-patch-inventory.md:117,
    docs/research/09-xnu-usb-gs101.md:100,183.
  - Fastboot USB IDs 18d1:d001 / 18d1:4ee0:
    tools/phone-state:6, tools/hang-recover:49.
  - Recovery/Android -> Fastboot (adb reboot bootloader):
    tools/to-fastboot.sh:14, tools/hang-recover:62, docs/reviews/pstore-review-1.md:82,
    docs/HANDOFF.md:67,357,365, NOTES.md:38.
  - Self-reset timer bounds:
    tools/hang-recover:10 (90s wait bound, 300s cap), tools/probe-run:9 (30s bound),
    tools/xrun:37-39,83-88, docs/HANDOFF.md:354,368.
  - Staged USBNET command:
    tools/sweet-usbnet.sh:14, tools/xrun:63.
"""

